Please note that starting in 2018, Stanford Cancer Center standardized and rationalized the tagging of tumor boards in the EHR.

**Update: Added TB Emails patient source to Tumor Board encounters plot**

This release adds a new data source to the "Tumor Board Encounters Over Time" plot: patients identified from internal Thoracic Tumor Board communications and dark-mining analysis of oncologist emails. This method surfaces Tumor Board patients not captured by the current structured-data definition.
Note that the number of encounters can be viewed by hovering on the datapoint for the other series, but this information is not available for the `tb_emails` series.


