## Pediatric Brain Tumor









In the November 2026 [pediatric brain tumor cohort](brain_tumor_cohort.qmd), **1,059 of 2,792 patients** had at least one tumor board encounter, across **6,870 distinct encounters**.

Patients were aged 0 through 18 at their first qualifying diagnosis. Encounters are counted at any age when `visit_source_value` in OMOP `visit_occurrence` contains “tumor board” (case-insensitive). This identifies a recorded tumor board visit, not necessarily a brain tumor-specific board.

